{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-al-warqa-3","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"al-warqa-3-al-warqa-al-warqa","about":"Al Warqa 3 Dubai is the third neighborhood of five in the Al Warqa residential area. It is located on the southeast side of Dubai Creek as it is a beautiful urban residential area ideal for families and individuals alike. The community includes villas and apartments and offers all major amenities within easy reach. Community parks, sports fields and playgrounds make this an attractive location for families with children.There are many schools nearby Al Warqa 3, including Ignite School 0.9 km away and GEMS' own English medium school 1.0 km away. As for supermarkets and hypermarkets, there are several options in the area. For example, Fresh &amp; Fast grocery stores, as well as Al Taif Star Grocery and Shorooq Al Warqa Grocery Store. Al Warqa 3 Dubai Park is the largest park in the neighborhood. It is also known as the Great Warqa Park.Like the rest of the residential neighborhood, Al Warqa 3 is close to many bus stations. This makes it easy to travel to and from this neighborhood in Dubai. From the complex, it takes about 19 minutes to Dubai Mall, 30 minutes to Palm Jumeirah, 29 minutes to Burj Al Arab and 34 minutes to Walk JBR.Dubai International Airport (DXB) is approximately 14 minutes away and the new Al Maktoum International Airport is approximately 44 minutes away.","price":15000000,"title":"Al Warqa 3","bitrix":{"id":676,"pf_id":null,"source":null,"project_id":"Al Warqa 3","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Al Warqa 3","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"Al Warqa","project_location":"Al Warqa"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/1954/images/2024/05/17/340x252/5lbZphI2DKsvvgzAN8Jk0iaebSPLheTW8moZS2WP.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/1954/images/2024/05/17/464x312/5lbZphI2DKs